    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Neutrals",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Goar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "In his youth, this mighty lord once stood fast against an army from hell and single-handedly defeated them by sealing the gateway that spew them. He then became sovereign of his realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Baalhu",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Every child trembles at the hearing of this most infamous name. This lord of hell is known for his blood thirsts. It is said that he once ate 1000 slaves at a banquet given by Bethrezen for a victory against the kingdom of light.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ardobert",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Kahath",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "High Council Messenger",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Bring Eye",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vaglan \n\u0022You have the Eye! This is a wise choice; the Empire will just have to find another way... Now escort me to your capital!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022In order to spread the word of the Highfather over the lands, we have need of a guide to help us in our conquest of the Highlands, where the Legions reside.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022There is a Human who lives high in the mountain range near the Legions capital. We have had contact with him, and he has agreed to guide us into the Highlands on condition we retrieve Doragon\u0027s Eye.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp CaptureNisseland",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We are sure the Elves have the Eye...  But there isn\u0027t a trace of it in this town. We will have search further.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Taura",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thrunn of the Lance \n\u0022The Elven people are everywhere; you are not rid of us yet! We will not tolerate your forces in our cities, leave if you wish to survive...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0029",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loc Elf Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "High Council Messenger \n\u0022The Elven High council has declared that the Elven people will tolerate your presence no more. Your greedy ways and arrogant disrespect of our lands and our people have cost you a steep price indeed...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "High Council Messenger \n\u0022Do not count on our help, and do not attempt to contact us, or you will regret it.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisors \n\u0022Do not place any importance on the petty threats of the Elves. This simply gives us reason to take their towns and villages. Proceed as planned.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Dullahan",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves \n\u0022We will never tell you anything, and never give you what you seek! Pain is all you shall receive!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leg Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Our information on the Empire movements indicate they wish to eliminate us from the Highlands. Thus far, the thick mountain range has protected our northern territories adequately.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We do not yet know exactly when or how the Empire plans its strike, but it could become an...irritating...distraction. We must find out, and soon...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Elves\u0027 Moribund",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022This place is strangely quiet... Tales have been told of ancient Elves entering this place, and never returning...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The dead are rising from the ground!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN002e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leg Capture Kanna",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Inhabitants \n\u0022Finally you have come to rescue us! We will forever worship you as our true Master!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0033",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0035",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loc Dullahan",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022This is the city of Dullahan, Milord. It will be heavily fortified- are we prepared for this battle?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0039",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Forest Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The Elves have cultured the forests heavily to prevent any intruders from penetrating. This will make progress slow, but not impossible.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legions Meet Vaglan",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vaglan \n \u0022My name is Vaglan. Let me explain this to you simply: If you do not retrieve Doragon\u0027s Eye for me, I will escort the Empire into the Highlands, to certain victory over your poorly protected cities.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vaglan \n\u0022I offer my services to the one that brings me the Eye first. I will wait for you in my hilltop sanctuary.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN003c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vaglan(Legions) Emp win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vaglan(Legions) Leg Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN003e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dullahan Guard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Bring Eye",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vaglan \n\u0022You have the Eye! This is a wise choice, for the victory of your troops is assured under my guidance. Now escort me to your capital!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vaglan(Emp) Emp Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vaglan(Emp) Legions Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loc Dullahan County",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves \n\u0022Have you not understood our warning? Stay away from us!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nelly\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Nelly \n\u0022Even if my Elven kin won\u0027t talk to you, I\u0027 ll still sell to you.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leg Loc Elf Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Beware Master, for many Elves live in these lands, and they do hate us nearly as much as we hate them. They may attack us simply on sight.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spawn Elf1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN0044",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spawn Elf 2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loc Nisseland",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0023",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The city of Nisseland lies ahead of us. It is an important trading port for the Elves, and we will certainly disrupt their organization by capturing it.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leg Loc Nisseland",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0024",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Master, the city of Nisseland lies ahead of us. It is an important trading port for the Elves, and we will cruelly disrupt their organization by capturing it.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leg Capture Nisseland",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We are sure the Elves have the Eye, but there isn\u0027t a trace of it in this town. We will have search further.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Capture Kanna",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Inhabitants \n\u0022The city of Kanna will never be oppressed by Empire forces... We will fight this invasion!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Watchtower Alert",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sentry \n\u0022Alert the watchtower! Intruders!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254UN004b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leg Loc Dullahan County",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves \n\u0022Demon pigs, we\u0027ll send you back to your pits!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0029",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leg Loc Dullahan",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV0029",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The city of Dullahan is ahead, Master. Although the Elves have fortified this city, it should be no match for our forces!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S254SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S254EV002a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loot Grubbery1",
